Open Island
-----------

Juice's session engine comes from Open Island 1.2.1, copyright the Open Island contributors, under the
GNU General Public License, version 3:
  https://github.com/Octane0411/open-vibe-island, commit b50f87aa7d58af1478837d48909eb68baa37f9b9
Its source is in Vendor/open-vibe-island exactly as released, with its own LICENSE.

Built from it unchanged:
- the OpenIslandCore library;
- the OpenIslandHooks helper, compiled with its entry point renamed so that Juice's helper (Sources/IslandHooks) can
  run before it;
- ten of OpenIslandApp's engine files, linked from Sources/IslandEngine/Vendored: AgentSession+Presentation.swift,
  AppModelTypes.swift, ForegroundTerminalSessionProbe.swift, IslandSurface.swift, KeystrokeInjector.swift,
  ProcessMonitoringCoordinator.swift, TerminalJumpService.swift, TerminalJumpTargetResolver.swift,
  TerminalSessionAttachmentProbe.swift and TerminalTextSender.swift.

Changed for Juice since September 2026. Each changed file says so in its first lines; scripts/vendor-derive.sh
writes it from Open Island's file and a patch:
- Sources/IslandEngine/Derived/ActiveAgentProcessDiscovery.swift, with Patches/active-agent-profiles.patch: finds the
  sessions of every Claude Code and Codex profile folder, not only ~/.claude and ~/.codex.
- Sources/IslandEngine/Derived/SessionDiscoveryCoordinator.swift, with Patches/bounded-transcripts.patch: discovers
  and follows sessions through Juice's own scanners (Sources/IslandEngine/Rollouts), which read session files in
  bounded pieces.
- Tests/VendorEngineTests: seven of Open Island's engine tests, importing IslandEngine instead of OpenIslandApp.

Reworked for Juice from Open Island's code in September 2026, each saying so in its first line:
- Sources/IslandEngine/Rollouts/ClaudeTranscriptScanner.swift, from Sources/OpenIslandCore/ClaudeTranscriptDiscovery.swift
  (ClaudeTranscriptDiscovery): the same transcripts, with every read bounded.
- Sources/IslandEngine/Rollouts/CodexRolloutScanner.swift, from Sources/OpenIslandCore/CodexSessionTracking.swift
  (CodexRolloutDiscovery): the same rollouts, with every read bounded.
- Sources/IslandEngine/Rollouts/CodexRolloutTracker.swift, from Sources/OpenIslandCore/CodexSessionTracking.swift
  (CodexRolloutWatcher): follows a rollout with bounded reads.
- Sources/IslandEngine/OpenCode/OpenCodePlugin.swift, from Sources/OpenIslandApp/Resources/open-island-opencode.js: the
  same plugin for OpenCode 1, made to load under OpenCode 2 too, with no debug log.

Everything else (App, Sources, JuiceCore, Widget, Tests and scripts) is Juice's own code, under the same licence.


